AttenGW adapter (gravyzoo_adapters.attengw)

This adapter runs AttenGW of Victoria Tiki and Eliu Huerta as its author
published it:

    https://github.com/victoria-tiki/AttenGW (commit 4ffe6ab68869c4a86650ee2ecb0dc50f9334a2ee)

published/model_tcn_earlyfusion.py is that repository's
models/model_tcn_earlyfusion.py, unchanged. The PSD, whitening, windows,
normalisation and smoothed_max trigger in search.py follow downloader.py,
data_generator.py and inference/infer.py of that repository, rewritten to read a
segment held in memory. The checkpoints are not included here: they are fetched
from the author's repository and checked against the sha256 pinned in card.py.
